# English-first project

- Write maintained documentation, comments, default UI, CLI/help/errors and
  generated report text in English, including the standalone `AndroidPort/`.
- Keep optional translations in explicit locale catalogs. Default and missing
  translation fallback must be English.
- Prefer English for new message keys and identifiers. Preserve compatibility
  for existing persisted tokens, paths, schemas and external references.
- Preserve upstream legal wording, original game/imported data and immutable
  historical evidence verbatim. Add English explanation when needed.
- Do not classify an active guide or current UI as historical to avoid translating it.
- Preserve IDs, commands, paths, hashes, evidence limits and acceptance status
  when translating existing material. Translation does not authorize rebuilding
  ROM datasets, repeating benchmarks or promoting unverified results.
- Follow `docs/development/ENGLISH_FIRST.md` for scope and migration status.
